From: Christian Kastner <ckk@kvr.at>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 09:28:00 +0200
Subject: Improve rpc-server and export-graph-ops names.

Tests are generally prefixed with -test, so rename export-graph-ops
accordingly.

rpc-server is probably too generic a name for /usr/bin. Because it
should work with any ggml application, it is renamed to ggml-rpc-server.

Applied-Upstream: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/25045
---
 SECURITY.md                     |   2 +-
 tests/CMakeLists.txt            |   8 +-
 tests/export-graph-ops.cpp      | 226 ----------------------------------------
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp      |   2 +-
 tests/test-export-graph-ops.cpp | 226 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/rpc/CMakeLists.txt        |   2 +-
 tools/rpc/README.md             |  34 +++---
 7 files changed, 250 insertions(+), 250 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 tests/export-graph-ops.cpp
 create mode 100644 tests/test-export-graph-ops.cpp

